#. type: Title ===
#: gerbview.adoc:171
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layers Manager"
msgstr "层管理器"

#. type: Named 'alt' AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: gerbview.adoc:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "gerbview_layer_manager_png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: gerbview.adoc:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "images/gerbview_layer_manager.png"
msgstr "images/zh/gerbview_layer_manager.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:178
msgid ""
"The Layers Manager controls and displays visibility of all layers. An arrow indicates the active "
"layer, and each layer can be shown or hidden with the checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"图层管理器用于控制和显示所有图层的可见性。一个箭头指示当前活动图层，每个图层均可通过复选框进行显示或"
"隐藏。"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:180
msgid "Mouse button assignments:"
msgstr "鼠标按钮作用："

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:182
msgid "Left click: select the active layer"
msgstr "左键点击：选择活动层"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:183
msgid "Right click: show/hide/sort layers options"
msgstr "右键点击：显示/隐藏/排序层选项"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:184
msgid "Middle click or double click (on color swatch): select the layer color"
msgstr "中键点击或在颜色标识上双击：选择层的颜色"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:188
msgid ""
"The Layers tab allows you to control the visibility and color of all loaded Gerber and drill "
"layers.  The Items tab allows you to control the color and display of the grid, D Codes, and "
"negative objects."
msgstr ""
"图层选项卡允许您控制所有已加载的 Gerber 和钻孔图层的可见性和颜色。 项目选项卡允许您控制网格、D 代码"
"和负片对象的颜色和显示方式。"

#. type: Title ==
#: gerbview.adoc:189
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commands in menu bar"
msgstr "菜单栏命令"

#. type: Title ===
#: gerbview.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "File menu"
msgstr "文件菜单"

#. type: Named 'alt' AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: gerbview.adoc:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "gerbview_file_menu_png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: gerbview.adoc:193
#, no-wrap
msgid "images/gerbview_file_menu.png"
msgstr "images/zh/gerbview_file_menu.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:199
msgid ""
"*Export to PCB Editor* is a limited capability to export Gerber files into a KiCad PCB. The final "
"result depends on what features of the RS-274X format are used in the original Gerber files: "
"rasterized items cannot be converted (typically negative objects), flashed items are converted to "
"vias, lines are converted to track segments (or graphic lines for non-copper layers)."
msgstr ""
"*导出到PCB编辑器* 是一项有限功能，用于将 Gerber 文件导出到 KiCad PCB 中。最终结果取决于原始 Gerber "
"文件中使用的 RS-274X 格式的哪些特性：栅格化项目无法转换（通常为负对象），闪烁项目转换为过孔，线条转"
"换为导线段（或非铜层的图形线条）。"

#. type: Title ===
#: gerbview.adoc:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tools menu"
msgstr "工具菜单"

#. type: Named 'alt' AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: gerbview.adoc:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "gerbview_tools_menu_png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: gerbview.adoc:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "images/gerbview_tools_menu.png"
msgstr "images/zh/gerbview_tools_menu.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:205
msgid "*List DCodes* shows the D Code information for all layers."
msgstr "*列表 DCodes* 显示所有层的 D 代码信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:206
msgid "*Show Source* displays the Gerber file contents of the active layer in a text editor."
msgstr "*显示源文件* 在文本编辑器中显示当前活动层的 Gerber 文件内容。"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:207
msgid "*Measure Tool* allows measuring the distance between two points."
msgstr "*测量工具* 可以测量两点之间的距离。"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:208
msgid "*Clear Current Layer* erases the contents of the active layer."
msgstr "*清除当前图层* 删除活动图层的内容。"

#. type: Title ==
#: gerbview.adoc:209
#, no-wrap
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "打印"

#. type: Plain text
#: gerbview.adoc:214
msgid ""
"To print layers, use the image:images/icons/print_button_24.png[print_button_png] icon or the *File "
"-> Print* menu."
msgstr ""
"要打印图层，请使用 image:images/icons/print_button_24.png[print_button_png] 图标或 *文件 -> 打印* 菜"
"单。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: gerbview.adoc:220
msgid ""
"Be sure items are inside the printable area. Use image:images/icons/sheetset_24.png[sheetset_png] "
"to select a suitable page format."
msgstr ""
"确保所有内容均位于可打印区域内。使用 image:images/icons/sheetset_24.png[sheetet_png] 选择合适的页面"
"格式。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: gerbview.adoc:224
msgid ""
"Note that many photoplotters support a large plottable area, much bigger than the page sizes used "
"by most printers. Moving the entire layer set may be required."
msgstr ""
"请注意，许多光绘仪支持较大的绘图区域，远大于大多数打印机使用的页面尺寸。可能需要移动整个图层集。"

